The included SVGs are unmodified official 24px Outlined symbols (weight 400).
Their paths are embedded in app/components/materialSymbolPaths.ts for offline
rendering with react-native-svg on web and Android; no remote font is loaded.

Application name -> Google symbol:
stop -> stop
settings -> settings
home -> home
bluetooth -> bluetooth
battery -> battery_full
notes -> settings_input_antenna
moon -> dark_mode
sun -> light_mode
power -> power_settings_new
